          "holding": "The Court of Appeals affirmed, holding that FOIL's personal privacy exemption does not permit an agency to withhold categorically all disciplinary records relating to unsubstantiated complaints; the agency must review each record individually and articulate a particularized and specific justification, disclosing with redactions where redaction would prevent an unwarranted invasion of privacy.",
